    ~ obietnica_antkowi = true
    Jaromir laid a hand on his shoulder.
    “If it’s him,” he said, “nobody will get him. I promise.”
    Antek nodded without raising his eyes, and only at the door did Jaromir notice that his friend’s cheeks were wet. # dalej
    -> oblawa
*   [Tell him it’s only an animal.]
    “It’s a wolf, Antek,” Jaromir said gently. “A hungry wolf. Franek’s been gone more than a year.”
    Antek looked at him as if Jaromir had struck him across the face. He stood up and left without a word of farewell. # dalej
