    “Here!” Jaromir shouted. “He’s here!”
    A shot cracked. The white wolf jerked as if a fist had struck him in the side, rolled over in the snow – and sprang to his feet. He leapt the trunk and vanished into the thicket on the forest side. On the white ground there remained a streak of blood, long and red as a ribbon. # pokaz: strzal
    “Hit him!” the gamekeeper bellowed. “He won’t get far!”
