# tlo: odwilz
In March the frost let go. The snow ran off the fields in dirty streams, and from the young wood below the forest birdsong could be heard once more.
{ ekwipunek ? szczeniak:
    ~ ekwipunek += szczenie_psa
    {imie_psa} licked his wounds until they mended, though he never ran as he once had. In spring the bitch at Staś’s had a litter, and one of the pups – russet, with a white patch on his chest – was the very spit of his father. Jaromir took him home. # pokaz: szczenie
}
{ pies_zginal:
    ~ ekwipunek += szczenie_psa
    In spring the bitch at Staś’s had a litter. One of the pups – russet, with a white patch on his chest – was the living image of {imie_psa} in years gone by. Old Staś brought him over in his cap and set him on the doorstep without a word. # pokaz: szczenie
}
The wolves were not seen again. Only sometimes, on moonlit nights, a lone howl came from deep in the forest – and Jaromir could not have said whether it held a lament or a warning. # pokaz: wilk
